  "prototypeNotes": [
    "This checklist starts with Race identities and proceeds through the declared catalog review order.",
    "Metis deformities and initial Gifts begin blocked because candidate identities remain unresolved.",
    "A check cannot pass without a versioned evidence record.",
    "Reviewing ownership identities for Gifts does not require runtime Gift effect implementation.",
    "Completing this checklist does not by itself finalize the decision set; formal decisions and reconciliation remain required.",
    "Chronicle owns checklist validation, evidence integrity, status calculation, diagnostics, fingerprints, and promotion enforcement.",
    "Assigned Rule Set reviewers own the actual source-backed review work."
